## AdsApi

### Create ad preview with pin or image
## Create ad preview with pin or image
POST https://api.pinterest.com/v5/ad_accounts/{{ad_account_id}}/ad_previews
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
 
}


### Get targeting analytics for ads
## Get targeting analytics for ads
GET https://api.pinterest.com/v5/ad_accounts/{{ad_account_id}}/ads/targeting_analytics?adIds={{adIds}}&startDate={{startDate}}&endDate={{endDate}}&targetingTypes={{targetingTypes}}&columns={{columns}}&granularity={{granularity}}&clickWindowDays={{clickWindowDays}}&engagementWindowDays={{engagementWindowDays}}&viewWindowDays={{viewWindowDays}}&conversionReportTime={{conversionReportTime}}&attributionTypes={{attributionTypes}}&reportingTimezone={{reportingTimezone}}&sortColumns={{sortColumns}}&sortAscending={{sortAscending}}
Accept: application/json

### Get ad analytics
## Get ad analytics
GET https://api.pinterest.com/v5/ad_accounts/{{ad_account_id}}/ads/analytics?pinIds={{pinIds}}&startDate={{startDate}}&endDate={{endDate}}&adIds={{adIds}}&columns={{columns}}&granularity={{granularity}}&clickWindowDays={{clickWindowDays}}&engagementWindowDays={{engagementWindowDays}}&viewWindowDays={{viewWindowDays}}&conversionReportTime={{conversionReportTime}}&campaignIds={{campaignIds}}&reportingTimezone={{reportingTimezone}}
Accept: application/json

### Create ads
## Create ads
POST https://api.pinterest.com/v5/ad_accounts/{{ad_account_id}}/ads
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
 
}


### Get ad
## Get ad
GET https://api.pinterest.com/v5/ad_accounts/{{ad_account_id}}/ads/{{ad_id}}
Accept: application/json

### List ads
## List ads
GET https://api.pinterest.com/v5/ad_accounts/{{ad_account_id}}/ads?bookmark={{bookmark}}&pageSize={{pageSize}}&order={{order}}&campaignIds={{campaignIds}}&adGroupIds={{adGroupIds}}&adIds={{adIds}}&entityStatuses={{entityStatuses}}
Accept: application/json

### Update ads
## Update ads
PATCH https://api.pinterest.com/v5/ad_accounts/{{ad_account_id}}/ads
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
 
}


### Create ad preview records for one or more ad groups
## Create ad preview records for one or more ad groups
POST https://api.pinterest.com/v5/ad_accounts/{{ad_account_id}}/campaign_ad_preview
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
 
}


### Delete ad preview records for one or more ad groups
## Delete ad preview records for one or more ad groups
DELETE https://api.pinterest.com/v5/ad_accounts/{{ad_account_id}}/campaign_ad_preview?adGroupIds={{adGroupIds}}
Accept: application/json

### Fetch ad preview records for one or more ad groups
## Fetch ad preview records for one or more ad groups
GET https://api.pinterest.com/v5/ad_accounts/{{ad_account_id}}/campaign_ad_preview?adGroupIds={{adGroupIds}}
Accept: application/json
